/**
 * @file NgtD.cnl
 * Test case for linNet.
 *
 * This test case proves, that linNet has no problems with a system, which
 * has a nominator power in s that is greater than the denominator power.
 * In this circuit we get such a result for the input current I_in due to
 * a directly connected capacitor C.
 *
 * Octave has problems to plot the time domain result, which would contain
 * a Dirac function and emits the unspecific error message: "This
 * descriptor system cannot be converted to regular state-space form."
 * MATLAB also rejects the plot but it responds with a clear and
 * appropriate error message.
